      "value": "Just to let everyone know, there is an older feature request for this same thing that already has some traction. Please upvote this one as well! Its for a native linux vrchat build, which would work natively on the new Steam Frame and Steam Machine\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/native-linux-build",
